  "remaining_boundary": "Actual Measure.pi centered variance-one scalar Gaussian for every n including0; true function-square/Phi-square/all-partial-square/full-sum energy L1 plus homogeneous entropy<=2 coordinate-square-sum integral. Only n,f,C2,compact support inputs. Default Pi sup norm is not Euclidean gradient energy. No RMS marginal smoothness, L1/domain/LSI certificate or positive dimension/mass premise. Finite Hilbert law/orthonormal gradient Parseval, noncompact cutoff32/33, separate T2/FIRST4.6 and all paper main/work/composition remain open.",
  "status": "focused-compiled-only-independent-wholeproof-blind-source-admission-pending"
